<title>CHINA: Refrigerator Compressor '96 net jumps.</title>
<headline>Refrigerator Compressor '96 net jumps.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>(millions of yuan unless stated, against 1995 figures)</p>
<p> Turnover	 1,163.58	 vs	 733.72</p>
<p> Net profit	 109.79	 vs	 86.33</p>
<p> Net asset per share     2.84 yuan   vs   2.61 yuan</p>
<p> Earnings per share	0.45 yuan  vs   0.495 yuan</p>
<p>Company name: Shanghai Refrigerator Compressor Co Ltd</p>
<p>Note: the results were published in a company statement on Wednesday. The net profit numbers are based on international accounting standards. Other figures are based on domestic accounting standards.</p>
<p>Based on domestic accounting standards, the 1996 net profit was 146.44 million yuan, against 109.39 million yuan in 1995.</p>
<p>The company's board of directors proposed a three-for-10 bonus issue for all shareholders based on the 1996 net, pending approval from shareholders at a meeting on a date yet to be fixed, the statement said.</p>
</text>
